{
  "id": "story-script",
  "step": 3,
  "name": "故事與分鏡腳本",
  "description": "步驟 3：以廣告編劇角度產生廣告腳本並拆成分鏡。",
  "version": 1,
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z",
  "target": {
    "kind": "text",
    "model": ""
  },
  "system": "你是觀光廣告編劇，負責把地方故事寫成短影音廣告腳本並拆成分鏡。每個分鏡要能用一張圖與一段短影片呈現。規則：只能使用下方提供的寺廟資料與使用者故事，不可自行補寫歷史年代、人物或傳說；不得出現對神明不敬的動作、台詞或畫面；畫面中不可出現可辨識的真實民眾臉孔。",
  "template": "請為以下內容寫一支 {{series.duration}} 秒的直式短影音廣告腳本，並拆成分鏡。\n\n寺廟：{{temple.name}}（{{temple.district}}，主祀{{temple.deity}}，創建於{{temple.builtYear}}）\n系列風格：{{series.style}}\n影片方向：{{series.direction}}\n系列共同角色：{{characters}}\n使用者上傳的照片：{{photos}}\n\n故事：\n{{story}}\n\n要求：各分鏡秒數加總等於 {{series.duration}} 秒；每格寫出場景、角色動作、鏡頭運動、旁白與字幕；場景盡量對應使用者上傳的照片。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "temple.name",
      "label": "廟名",
      "required": true,
      "example": "鄞山寺"
    },
    {
      "name": "temple.district",
      "label": "行政區",
      "required": false,
      "example": "淡水區"
    },
    {
      "name": "temple.deity",
      "label": "主祀神明",
      "required": false,
      "example": "定光古佛"
    },
    {
      "name": "temple.builtYear",
      "label": "創建年（西元）",
      "required": false,
      "example": "1824"
    },
    {
      "name": "series.style",
      "label": "系列視覺風格",
      "required": true,
      "example": "溫暖寫實、黃昏暖色調"
    },
    {
      "name": "series.direction",
      "label": "影片方向",
      "required": false,
      "example": "在地歷史故事"
    },
    {
      "name": "series.duration",
      "label": "影片秒數",
      "required": true,
      "example": "15"
    },
    {
      "name": "characters",
      "label": "系列共同角色",
      "required": false,
      "example": "導覽員阿亮：20 多歲青年，白襯衫、背相機"
    },
    {
      "name": "photos",
      "label": "照片說明",
      "required": false,
      "example": "1. 廟宇正面；2. 廟埕石獅；3. 屋脊剪黏"
    },
    {
      "name": "story",
      "label": "故事（已確認版）",
      "required": true,
      "example": "老一輩說，當年移民渡海來台，帶著定光古佛的香火在淡水落腳。"
    }
  ],
  "output": {
    "format": "json",
    "schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "title",
        "shots"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "title": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "logline": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "shots": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "index",
              "seconds",
              "scene",
              "action",
              "camera"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "index": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "seconds": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "scene": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "photoIndex": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "action": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "camera": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "narration": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "subtitle": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "characters": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
